  "reasoning": "The facts describe that the defendant, 邓某, paid large sums of money to hospital staff (charging员、药师及医生) in order to induce them to prescribe specific drugs, thereby obtaining improper benefits. This conduct constitutes offering bribes to public officials (medical staff) for personal gain, which is defined under the Criminal Law as 行贿罪. No other crimes such as theft, illegal hunting, or teaching criminal methods are present in the facts. Therefore, the sole appropriate charge is 行贿.",
